   (NAACL-HLT), ELECTR NETWORK, JUN 06-11, 2021},
Organization = {Assoc Computat Linguist, N Amer Chapter},
Abstract = {We present a new information extraction system that can automatically
   construct temporal event graphs from a collection of news documents from
   multiple sources, multiple languages (English and Spanish for our
   experiment), and multiple data modalities (speech, text, image and
   video). The system advances state-of-the-art from two aspects: (1)
   extending from sentence-level event extraction to cross-document
   cross-lingual cross-media event extraction, coreference resolution and
   temporal event tracking; (2) using human curated event schema library to
   match and enhance the extraction output. We have made the dockerlized
   system publicly available for research purpose at GitHub(1), with a demo
   video(2).},
