   Machinery},
Abstract = {In this paper, we present a contribution to IR modeling. We propose an
   approach that computes on the fly, a Personalized Social Document
   Representation (PSDR) of each document per user based on his social
   activities. The PSDRs are used to rank documents with respect to a
   query. This approach has been intensively evaluated on a large public
   dataset, showing significant benefits for personalized search.},
